@startuml
title UML sequence — Fixed line first, the model within the timeout (L2-160, L2-163)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
actor "Guardian" as g
box "Frontend — Angular app" #E0F2FE
participant "ph-agent-message" as bubble
participant LearningBondAgentBubble as glue
participant LEARNING_BOND_API as client
end box
box "Backend — PromiseHub.Api" #D1FADF
participant LearningBondGuardianEndpoints as api
end box
box "Backend — PromiseHub.Application" #ECFDF3
participant LearningBondAgent as agent
participant AgentFallbackCopy as fallback
end box
box "Backend — PromiseHub.Infrastructure" #FEF0C7
participant ILanguageModel as llm
end box
g -> bubble : opens learning-bond-consent
bubble -> bubble : renders the page's approved line at once (L2-163 c5)
glue -> client : askAgent(token, Consent)
client -> api : POST /g/learning-bond/{token}/agent {step}
api -> agent : AskAsync(request, ask)
agent -> fallback : Consent(household language, organization)
agent -> llm : ReplyAsync(step prompt, context, tools), LearningBond:Agent:TimeoutSeconds
alt slow, failing, refused, not end_turn, or unusable
  llm --> agent : cancelled, error or null
  agent --> api : {fixed, reply: null, source: "fixed"}; audit replied on Consent (fixed)
else usable reply in time
  llm --> agent : text
  agent --> api : {fixed, reply, source: "model"}; audit replied on Consent (model)
end
api --> client : 200
glue -> bubble : keeps the fixed line, or swaps in the reply (L2-160 c7)
g -> bubble : ticks the consent, types the name, continues to intake, review and submit without the model (L2-160 c4)
@enduml
